=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-audit-sql-project\" href=\"/tutorials/sql-data-analytics/data-quality-audit-sql-project/\"><span>65</span><span data-bn=\"Project: SQL Data Quality Audit\" data-en=\"Project: SQL Data Quality Audit\">Project: SQL Data Quality Audit</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"final-sql-analytics-portfolio-project\" href=\"/tutorials/sql-data-analytics/final-sql-analytics-portfolio-project/\"><span>66</span><span data-bn=\"Final Project: Retail SQL Analytics Portfolio\" data-en=\"Final Project: Retail SQL Analytics Portfolio\">Final Project: Retail SQL Analytics Portfolio</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/sql-data-analytics/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/sql-data-analytics/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/sql-data-analytics/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/sql-data-analytics/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"views\" data-tutorial=\"sql-data-analytics\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Modeling, Quality, and Performance · Chapter 59 / 66\" data-en=\"Data Modeling, Quality, and Performance · Chapter 59 of 66\">Data Modeling, Quality, and Performance · Chapter 59 of 66</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"View\" data-en=\"Views\">Views</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"View ব্যবহার করে relational data থেকে reproducible ও validated analytical result তৈরি করার পদ্ধতি শিখুন।\" data-en=\"A view stores a query definition and exposes it like a table. It centralizes repeated logic but does not automatically guarantee performance or correct governance.\">A view stores a query definition and exposes it like a table. It centralizes repeated logic but does not automatically guarantee performance or correct governance.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 60 min</span><span>Intermediate</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"সহজ ভাষায় View explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain Views in plain language.\">Explain Views in plain language.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Practice database ব্যবহার করে query লিখুন বা adapt করুন।\" data-en=\"Write or adapt a query using the practice database.\">Write or adapt a query using the practice database.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Result grain এবং গুরুত্বপূর্ণ NULL বা join behavior উল্লেখ করুন।\" data-en=\"State the result grain and important NULL or join behavior.\">State the result grain and important NULL or join behavior.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Result validate করে একটি limitation communicate করুন।\" data-en=\"Validate the result and communicate one limitation.\">Validate the result and communicate one limitation.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"View কী\" data-en=\"What Views means\">What Views means</h2><p data-bn=\"View বুঝতে প্রথমে source table-এর row grain, included population এবং expected output নির্ধারণ করতে হবে। SQL syntax নিজে decision নয়; এটি business question-কে reproducible query-তে প্রকাশ করে। ভুল grain বা population ব্যবহার করলে technically valid query-ও ভুল conclusion দিতে পারে।\" data-en=\"A view stores a query definition and exposes it like a table. It centralizes repeated logic but does not automatically guarantee performance or correct governance. The important first step is to define the row population and result grain before interpreting any returned value. SQL syntax is only useful when it represents the intended business question.\">A view stores a query definition and exposes it like a table. It centralizes repeated logic but does not automatically guarantee performance or correct governance. The important first step is to define the row population and result grain before interpreting any returned value. SQL syntax is only useful when it represents the intended business question.</p><div class=\"formula-block\"><span>SQL</span><code>CREATE VIEW completed_orders AS\nSELECT * FROM orders WHERE status='Completed';</code><button aria-label=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy-code\" data-copy-code=\"\" type=\"button\">Copy</button></div></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Data analyst কীভাবে ব্যবহার করেন\" data-en=\"How a data analyst uses it\">How a data analyst uses it</h2><p data-bn=\"Data analyst এই concept ব্যবহার করে repeatable analysis তৈরি করেন। Query run করার আগে filter, join key, date boundary ও unit লিখে রাখেন; run করার পরে row count, NULL, duplicate এবং control total যাচাই করেন। এই validation ছাড়া result দেখতে plausible হলেও reliable নাও হতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Analysts use views to publish approved metric logic, simplify access, and hide unnecessary source complexity. A responsible workflow records the filter rules, validates row counts, checks NULL behavior, and reconciles important totals before publishing the result.\">Analysts use views to publish approved metric logic, simplify access, and hide unnecessary source complexity. A responsible workflow records the filter rules, validates row counts, checks NULL behavior, and reconciles important totals before publishing the result.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Rule, dialect note ও common mistake\" data-en=\"Rules, dialect notes, and common mistakes\">Rules, dialect notes, and common mistakes</h2><p data-bn=\"Browser practice-এ sql.js-এর মাধ্যমে SQLite ব্যবহার করা হয়। Explanation portable SQL-কে গুরুত্ব দেয় এবং PostgreSQL syntax আলাদা হলে তা উল্লেখ করে। Query result temporary এবং current browser page-এর মধ্যেই থাকে। Common mistake হলো wrong grain-এ join বা aggregate করা, implicit conversion-এর ওপর নির্ভর করা, deterministic order না দেওয়া এবং NULL-কে zero ধরে নেওয়া। বড় query লেখার আগে ছোট verified result তৈরি করুন।\" data-en=\"The browser practice uses SQLite through sql.js. The course explanation emphasizes portable SQL and identifies PostgreSQL syntax where it differs. Query results are temporary and remain in the current browser page. Common mistakes include using the wrong grain, relying on implicit conversion, omitting deterministic ordering, or treating missing values as ordinary zeroes. Test the smallest useful result before extending the query.\">The browser practice uses SQLite through sql.js. The course explanation emphasizes portable SQL and identifies PostgreSQL syntax where it differs. Query results are temporary and remain in the current browser page. Common mistakes include using the wrong grain, relying on implicit conversion, omitting deterministic ordering, or treating missing values as ordinary zeroes. Test the smallest useful result before extending the query.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"View\" data-en=\"View\">View</h3><p data-bn=\"View: Named stored query exposed as a virtual table. এই term-এর অর্থ query context ও result grain-এর সঙ্গে মিলিয়ে বুঝতে হবে।\" data-en=\"Named stored query exposed as a virtual table.\">Named stored query exposed as a virtual table.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Semantic layer\" data-en=\"Semantic layer\">Semantic layer</h3><p data-bn=\"Semantic layer: Shared business definitions presented for analysis. এই term-এর অর্থ query context ও result grain-এর সঙ্গে মিলিয়ে বুঝতে হবে।\" data-en=\"Shared business definitions presented for analysis.\">Shared business definitions presented for analysis.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Encapsulation\" data-en=\"Encapsulation\">Encapsulation</h3><p data-bn=\"Encapsulation: Hiding lower-level complexity behind a stable interface. এই term-এর অর্থ query context ও result grain-এর সঙ্গে মিলিয়ে বুঝতে হবে।\" data-en=\"Hiding lower-level complexity behind a stable interface.\">Hiding lower-level complexity behind a stable interface.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Materialized view\" data-en=\"Materialized view\">Materialized view</h3><p data-bn=\"Materialized view: Stored query result refreshed separately in systems that support it. এই term-এর অর্থ query context ও result grain-এর সঙ্গে মিলিয়ে বুঝতে হবে।\" data-en=\"Stored query result refreshed separately in systems that support it.\">Stored query result refreshed separately in systems that support it.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Worked example: View\" data-en=\"Worked example: Views\">Worked example: Views</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"একজন retail analyst practice database-এ View apply করে এমন result তৈরি করবেন যা অন্য reviewer reproduce করতে পারবেন।\" data-en=\"A retail analyst needs to apply views to the practice database and produce a result that another reviewer can reproduce.\">A retail analyst needs to apply views to the practice database and produce a result that another reviewer can reproduce.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Business question, qualifying row, time period ও intended result grain লিখুন।\" data-en=\"State the business question, qualifying rows, time period, and intended result grain.\">State the business question, qualifying rows, time period, and intended result grain.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Required table inspect করে selected column ও join key ওই grain represent করে কিনা যাচাই করুন।\" data-en=\"Inspect the required tables and confirm that the selected columns and join keys represent that grain.\">Inspect the required tables and confirm that the selected columns and join keys represent that grain.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Browser practice area-তে SQL run করে একটি filter বা expression বদলে result compare করুন।\" data-en=\"Run the SQL in the browser practice area, then change one filter or expression and compare the result.\">Run the SQL in the browser practice area, then change one filter or expression and compare the result.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Interpretation লেখার আগে row count, NULL behavior ও অন্তত একটি control total validate করুন।\" data-en=\"Validate row counts, NULL behavior, and at least one control total before writing the interpretation.\">Validate row counts, NULL behavior, and at least one control total before writing the interpretation.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"View তখনই সঠিকভাবে apply হয়েছে যখন returned row stated question-এর উত্তর দেয় এবং validation evidence calculation-কে support করে।\" data-en=\"Views is correctly applied only when the returned rows answer the stated question and the validation evidence supports the calculation.\">Views is correctly applied only when the returned rows answer the stated question and the validation evidence supports the calculation.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/sql-data-analytics/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"View business question ও result grain-এর সঙ্গে ব্যবহার করতে হবে।\" data-en=\"A view stores a query definition and exposes it like a table.\">A view stores a query definition and exposes it like a table.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"SQL readable, filter-explicit এবং প্রয়োজন হলে deterministically ordered হওয়া উচিত।\" data-en=\"The SQL should be readable, deterministic where ordering matters, and explicit about filters.\">The SQL should be readable, deterministic where ordering matters, and explicit about filters.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Browser practice SQLite ব্যবহার করে; production difference PostgreSQL-orientedভাবে ব্যাখ্যা করা হয়।\" data-en=\"Browser practice uses SQLite; production examples explain PostgreSQL-oriented differences.\">Browser practice uses SQLite; production examples explain PostgreSQL-oriented differences.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Quality ও reconciliation check-এর পরে result publish করা উচিত।\" data-en=\"A result is publishable only after quality and reconciliation checks.\">A result is publishable only after quality and reconciliation checks.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PostgreSQL 18 Documentation — SQL Language ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/lang.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SQLite SQL Language Reference ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/sql-data-analytics/transactions/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Transaction\" data-en=\"Transactions\">Transactions</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/sql-data-analytics/indexes-and-explain/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Index ও EXPLAIN\" data-en=\"Indexes and EXPLAIN\">Indexes and EXPLAIN</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/sql-practice.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}